From: vgs499p <vgs499p@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 17:09:32 -0300
Subject: [PATCH 7/7] Install guest systems from the project's releases

An installer screen downloads a distribution and desktop from the
images-1 release, verifies each part and the unpacked erofs by SHA-256,
and records the account the guest creates at its first boot. Each system
has its own overlay disk; the one Berkut 1.0 bundled keeps its disk. The
runtime copies an account file found beside the overlay into the guest.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
